1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:04,180
Grandpa, Ellen, Philip, Robbie, you and me.

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:09,350
That's six steaks.

3
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,900
Don't forget Susan.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:15,280
Seven steaks.

5
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:18,940
Cooking dinner for the entire family is not so easy.

6
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:22,230
The shopping: the salad:

7
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:28,310
tomatoes, lettuce, cucumbers, and onions.

8
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:35,070
The main course: steak and potatoes.

9
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:39,050
Richard, how much broccoli do I need for seven people?

10
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:42,680
Marilyn, I have to tell you something.

11
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:45,180
At today's exercise class...

12
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:48,710
Yes, Richard.

13
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:55,010
Well, I didn't really exercise.

14
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:55,880
I knew it!

15
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,590
I wanted to, but Jack Davis needed a photographer.

16
00:00:59,590 --> 00:01:01,680
I'm sorry, Marilyn.

17
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,790
I don't understand. Did you exercise or not?

18
00:01:03,790 --> 00:01:06,680
No. Instead of exercising, I photographed the class.

19
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:08,120
And you didn't exercise?

20
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:13,510
No.

21
00:01:13,510 --> 00:01:18,870
There's another advanced class today at four o'clock.

22
00:01:18,870 --> 00:01:20,570
We'll go together.

23
00:01:20,570 --> 00:01:21,710
What about the bet?

24
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:30,120
Oh, the bet is still on, but you shop for the groceries.

25
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:35,410
Remember, you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

26
00:01:35,410 --> 00:01:39,590
You win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

27
00:01:39,590 --> 00:01:42,710
Including Susan.

28
00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:47,410
Four o'clock at the advanced exercise class. With me.

29
00:01:47,410 --> 00:01:48,100
Don't forget to breathe.

30
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:49,190
Skip, hop, front.

31
00:01:49,190 --> 00:01:50,410
Twist... again.... OK, now... scissors.

32
00:01:50,410 --> 00:01:54,100
This is fun. It's a piece of cake.

33
00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:56,470
Yeah. Just wait.

34
00:01:56,470 --> 00:02:02,640
5, 6, 7, go right, 1, 2, back,

35
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:06,470
2, 3 , 1, 2, 3, pony, pony...

36
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:14,000
1, 2, 3, kick... 1, 2, 3, kick... pony.

37
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:16,770
And twist, twist.

38
00:02:16,770 --> 00:02:19,320
OK. Let's pick up the pace.

39
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:21,520
How are you doing, Richard?

40
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:30,980
I can barely move.

41
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:36,500
2, 3, 4, front. Now we're going to run it off.

42
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:38,390
Front... knees up, knees up.

43
00:02:38,390 --> 00:02:42,060
OK. Finish off by jogging in place.

44
00:02:42,060 --> 00:02:43,940
OK. Keep those knees up.

45
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:46,230
All right. That's it for today.

46
00:02:46,230 --> 00:02:49,210
Thank you, everyone. See you next week.

47
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:52,040
Thank you, Jack, but no thank you.

48
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:57,500
The advanced exercise class is not so easy, huh?

49
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:04,810
No, no, you were right. I was wrong.

50
00:03:04,810 --> 00:03:08,470
Come on, Richard. Get up. Let's go.

51
00:03:08,470 --> 00:03:11,800
You have to cook dinner for the entire family.

52
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:16,550
Marilyn, I'm exhausted. I can't move.

53
00:03:16,550 --> 00:03:20,070
Oh, you'll do it. It's a piece of cake.

54
00:03:20,070 --> 00:03:23,740
Excuse me, Richard, Marilyn.

55
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:25,950
You are a terrific instructor, Jack.

56
00:03:25,950 --> 00:03:28,890
Thanks. But I have a question.

57
00:03:28,890 --> 00:03:32,500
Is this your very first advanced aerobics class?

58
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:34,830
Yes, it is.

59
00:03:34,830 --> 00:03:37,160
You are in great shape, Richard.

60
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:39,070
Very few people last in this class

61
00:03:39,070 --> 00:03:43,530
for the full hour the very first time.

62
00:03:43,530 --> 00:03:47,550
It's true. You are in great shape.

63
00:03:47,550 --> 00:03:48,750
Thanks!

64
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:51,750
I think we'll cook dinner together.
